  "ingredients": [
    "3 ounces spinach",
    "2 large eggs",
    "1.5 teaspoons extra-virgin olive oil",
    "0.5 teaspoon kosher salt",
    "2 cups all-purpose flour, or as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WxTKTBNr7getqRbeI-VJEIrO6n0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/254895-Homemade-Spinach-Pasta-DDMFS--4x3-Step-1-3fddfe73a54b428b896cb3d74f19c4ab.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254895/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine water and ice in a bowl. Preheat a skillet over medium heat; add spinach. Cook, stirring continuously, until spinach turns bright green, about 30 seconds.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rAPqB9ozoM68t5i5irlsYy_2vxY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/254895-Homemade-Spinach-Pasta-DDMFS--4x3-Step-2-d5b4da3897114aa2abd44b886a1754f7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254895/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Plunge into ice water bath; remove when spinach is lukewarm. Squeeze out excess moisture with cheesecloth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OiQAs6HIhRP8IZmn96VLnbVOCFY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/254895-Homemade-Spinach-Pasta-DDMFS--4x3-Step-3-02-60cfcaadc6b5448bafe29ce28b30713b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254895/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine spinach, eggs, olive oil, and salt in a food processor; blend until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lqabjVH7fFy-sygUImzWkdnAOiQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/254895-Homemade-Spinach-Pasta-DDMFS-4x3-Step-4-02-97fe05a916524144be53ba5868bb7130.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254895/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add flour; blend until dough no longer sticks to the blades, adding flour as needed.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ei3k84tFTIc_h0nytpZ9VE_SgN8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/254895-Homemade-Spinach-Pasta-DDMFS-4x3-Step-4-03-73865abe79b44ba5ba5be2a191646e08.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254895/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll dough into a ball; wrap in plastic wrap. Rest at room temperature for 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/91P4F4PgQSNuQu1qhBfG0CBeW0I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/254895-Homemade-Spinach-Pasta-DDMFS-4x3-Step-5-a8f9906b85bf42c6bde4ee7db4577de8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254895/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove plastic wrap from dough. Transfer to a work surface generously dusted with flour; cut dough into 4 pieces with a sharp knife.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aCP4SbWsQG7guWemlepF02QcBAE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/254895-Homemade-Spinach-Pasta-DDMFS-4x3-Step-6-01-021c71be68014917a6365bcbfc3d8469.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254895/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll out dough with a rolling pin to 1/4-inch thickness; shape into rectangles.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QDAus9iF6APQWelrAvOcvvYCKm8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/254895-Homemade-Spinach-Pasta-DDMFS-4x3-Step-6-02-71cb9834dac8404fb7c2ba604ea4caac.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254895/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dust pasta maker rollers with flour. Run the dough rectangles through a pasta maker on the widest setting. Repeat rolling dough through rollers, gradually reducing the setting to desired thickness.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XBACJe1YXqPadeQFGAOOtKd6EHk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/254895-Homemade-Spinach-Pasta-DDMFS-4x3-Step-7-01-b8b22e5ea9a6420992b18197bf32e843.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254895/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Change the pasta maker’s attachment to the preferred noodle shape; cut pasta with the pasta maker.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZIHcKPzEmoo_Ps4qpmLxaH-mkxE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/254895-Homemade-Spinach-Pasta-DDMFS-4x3-Step-7-023-c1121fe7b99d49a08a08cdc39f63c8a6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254895/step_10.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of water to a boil. Lower pasta gently into water; use a spoon to keep noodles from sticking together. Cook until pasta is firm but soft, 3 to 6 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2A3xCKyYWR_uwwk1nVM8mxl_1ds=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/254895-Homemade-Spinach-Pasta-DDMFS-4x3-Step-8-b810491796e946149d20c2959122b376.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254895/step_11.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from the water with tongs; transfer to a bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Sm4utV6oVLBemXDYJAIqM_lmYaE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/254895-Homemade-Spinach-Pasta-DDMFS-4x3-Step-91-d3293eb83e4f438bbe543944b5faa9a9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254895/step_12.webp"
    }
  ],
